{{!
    A managed resource. spec.forProvider is the CREATE REQUEST BODY and
    status.atProvider is the READ RESPONSE, which is the whole classification
    -- a Crossplane resource does not have to guess which of a person and the
    server owns a field, the way a single Terraform schema does.

    Anything that is not a scalar is a JSON string, as in the Terraform
    provider. See the README.
}}
